# ── Unity/IDE project files (regenerated on open) ────────────────────────────
# Scoped to unity/ on purpose. A blanket *.csproj / *.sln here also swallows
# sim/'s hand-written project files, which are the build definition for the
# runnable half of this repo — without them a fresh clone cannot compile.
unity/**/*.csproj
unity/**/*.unityproj
unity/**/*.sln
unity/**/*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
ExportedObj/
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# ── .NET (sim/) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.dll
*.exe
TestResults/
.dotnet/

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
